if you know what I mean.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:40.430
The thing is, the character
was so savage in the beginning

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:41.270
that he was naked.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:42.260
- So it makes sense.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:45.610
- Oh yeah, it wasn't like
I was making fun of him.

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:48.593
