00:04:56.053 --> 00:04:58.120
some not enough left to bury.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.870
- For both of you,

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:01.400
even though this is an action movie

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.320
and Sly is known for action movies,

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:06.083
