00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:14.200
And I think you really went there,

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.493
so if you could talk a
little bit about that.

00:05:17.853 --> 00:05:19.120
- (mumbles)

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.460
- Yeah, sure, so I feel like this Rambo,

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.170
all the previous Rambo's
have been about war,

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.970
