simple life, and then boom.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.290
I end up rebelling and going to Mexico and

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.440
the war starts again.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.673
He has to go and protect his family.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.580
And I do love that it sheds
light on the sex trafficking.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.400
Although Rambo isn't all about it,

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.380
it sheds light on it
and I feel like that was

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.050
super important because it's
a big problem in America.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:58.180
Everywhere actually.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:01.560
- Yes and this film, the
opportunity to the audience

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:05.410
to see a human being, its unique.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:10.370
Because it's not only an
action figure, an action icon,

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:13.660
the audience can see that human being with

00:06:15.234 --> 00:06:17.943
age, with a broken soul,

00:06:19.195 --> 00:06:22.070
and I think the audience can embrace

00:06:23.196 --> 00:06:24.029
being the hero.
- And I think that's why

00:06:24.029 --> 00:06:26.430
people love Sylvester Stallone is because

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.960
well one thing that was nice
about this is like you said,

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:32.270
